OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and warm
OL,6,Fevening to come with some hazy
OL,7,Fsunshine. Overnight patchy cloud is
OL,8,Fexpected to push in from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest, mainly effecting Cumbria,
OL,10,Fwhere the odd shower cannot be ruled
OL,11,Fout. Hill fog is also possible over
OL,12,Fthe Pennines.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FCloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fwill spread southwards throughout
OL,16,FFriday but tending to weaken as it
OL,17,Fdoes so. Many areas becoming dry by
OL,18,Fafternoon with sunny spells but
OL,19,Ffeeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
