OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry throughout the weekend with a mix
OL,7,Fof cloud and sunny spells. A band of
OL,8,Frain then likely to move across the
OL,9,Fregion during Monday. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnearer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
